AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:08984 "Cationic polymerization in which a cyclic monomer yields a monomeric unit that is either acyclic or contains fewer rings than the cyclic monomer.")
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:08984 doi:10.1515/pac-2020-1211)
