AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10025 "Examination standard recognized by national authority to serve in a state or economy as the basis for assigning nominal property values to other examination standards for the same kind-of-nominal-property.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:10025 goldbook:10019)
