AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10027 "Examination standard established through examination calibration with respect to a primary examination standard for a nominal property of the same kind-of-nominal-property.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:10027 goldbook:10019)
