AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10028 "Examination standard designated for the examination calibration of other examination standards for nominal properties of a given kind-of-nominal-property in a given organization or at a given location.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:10028 goldbook:10019)
