AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:10035 "certified nominal reference material")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10035 "Nominal reference material accompanied by documentation issued by an authoritative body and providing one or more specified nominal property values with examination uncertainty and examination traceability, using valid examination procedures.")
