AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:10325 "secondary sex organ")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:10325 "In the human female the accessory sex organs include the Fallopian tubes, uterus, vagina, and the external genitalia."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:10325 "In the human male, the accessory sex organs include the epididymis, vas deferens, ejaculatory duct, urethra, seminal vesicles, bulbourethral glands, prostate, and penis."^^xsd:string)
