AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:10900 "Forward (ventral) curvature of the spine in the lumbar and cervical regions.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:10900 "Some degree of lumbar curvature is normal. Excessive curvature (lumbar hyperlordosis) is sometimes called swayback."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:10900 "This posture is also associated with a rodent being in heat."^^xsd:string)
