AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11090 "Non-steroidal natural product from a plant that, because of a structural similarity to 17\\(\\upbeta\\)-estradiol can exert mild estrogenic effects, or antagonize them.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11090 "Examples include isoflavones and coumestans."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11090 "While foods containing phyto-estrogens are often promoted as beneficial, medical benefits are not well established."^^xsd:string)
