AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11165 "An example occurs during development of the prostate, in which mesenchyme of the urogenital sinus influences differentiation and patterning of the prostatic epithelium, and the developing epithelium induces prostatic mesenchymal cells to differentiate into smooth muscle and other prostatic stromal cells."^^xsd:string)
