AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11187 "As an experimental technique, RNAi uses designed sequences to silence a gene of interest."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11187 "Short hairpin RNAs (shRNA) are sequences, designed for improved effect in RNAi experiments, that have a base-paired stem representing the double-stranded portion and an intervening unpaired loop."^^xsd:string)
