AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11286 "Teratogens may act at vulnerable points in the development of gametes in parents or of organ development in the embryo and fetus."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11286 "Their modes of action include mimicry of morphogens (thus interference with morphogenesis), modulation of genes and gene expression, and direct alterations in protein function."^^xsd:string)
