AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11300 "Bilayer covering of the ovarian follicle (thus theca interna and externa), of which the theca interna is involved in production of androstenedione.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11300 goldbook:10387)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11300 goldbook:11056)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:11300 doi:10.1515/pac-2015-1202)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:11300 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11301))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11301 "thoracic duct")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11301 "Largest of the lymphatic vessels; it conducts lymph from its origin in the abdomen to the venous circulation at the junction of the left subclavian and jugular veins.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11301 goldbook:10318)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11301 goldbook:10904)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:11301 doi:10.1515/pac-2015-1202)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:11301 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11302))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11302 "thrombocytopenia")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11302 "Abnormally low concentration of platelets (thrombocytes) in the blood.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11302 "Thromocytopenia is an unwanted effect of some drugs and carries an increased risk of spontaneous bleeding."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:11302 doi:10.1515/pac-2015-1202)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:11302 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11303))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11303 "thymus")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11303 "Pyramid-shaped organ in the thoracic or cervical region of mammals, composed of lymphatic tissue in which minute concentric bodies (thymic corpuscles, the remnants of epithelial structures) are found.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11303 "Stem cells in the outer cortex of thymus develop into different kinds of T cells. Some migrate to the inner medulla and enter the bloodstream; those that do not may be destroyed to prevent autoimmune reactions."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11303 "This organ is necessary for the development of thymus-derived lymphocytes (T cells) and is the source of several hormones involved in T-cell maturation, for example, thymosin, thymopoietin, thymulin, and thymocyte humoral factor."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11303 "If a newborn’s thymus is removed, not enough T cells are produced, the spleen and lymph nodes have little tissue, and the immune system fails, causing a gradual, fatal wasting disease. Thymus removal in adults has little effect."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11303 goldbook:10674)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11303 goldbook:10904)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11303 goldbook:10925)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:11303 doi:10.1515/pac-2015-1202)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:11303 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11304))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11304 "thyroglossal duct")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11304 "Connection in the embryo between the site of initiation of development of the thyroid gland and its final location in the neck.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11304 goldbook:11305)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:11304 doi:10.1515/pac-2015-1202)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:11304 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:11305))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11305 "thyroid gland")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11305 "Bilobar endocrine gland, located below the prominence of cartilage surrounding the larynx (the Adam’s apple), that produces and secretes the hormones triiodothyronine (T3), thyroxin (T4), and calcitonin.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11305 goldbook:10494)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11305 goldbook:10657)
