AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11308 "Small, rounded mass of tissue, especially of lymphoid tissue; generally used to designate one of the paired palatine tonsils.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11308 goldbook:10905)
