AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11319 "Measurement of maternal serum levels of alpha-fetoprotein, human chorionic gonadotropin, and estriol, usually in the second trimester of pregnancy, that can serve as an indicator of risk for certain fetal chromosomal abnormalities and neural tube defects.")
