AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11384 "The proteins signal by binding to cell-surface G-protein coupled receptors of the Frizzled family that signal to members of the Dishevelled (Dsh) family of cytoplasmic phosphoproteins."^^xsd:string)
