AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11656 "CA1-pyramidal cells provide an output pathway from the hippocampus involved in long-term learning and memory."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11656 "They are more susceptible to ischemia and hypoxia than the neighbouring CA3-pyramidal cells."^^xsd:string)
