AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11754 "One of several peptides (including the enkephalins) that activates the body’s opiate receptors, causing an analgesic effect; literally, endogenous morphine-like substance.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11754 goldbook:11755)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11754 goldbook:11974)
