AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11786 "Protein that promotes and guides the growth of neurons and facilitates the survival of mature neurons by suppressing cell death.")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType OMO:0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:11786 "GDNF")
