AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11790 "Damage-induced proliferation, enlargement and overgrowth of glial cells, often astrocytes in the central nervous system, resulting in an astrocytic scar.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11790 goldbook:11614)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:11790 goldbook:11616)
