AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11808 "Maintenance in vitro of fresh prepared slices of the hippocampus.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11808 "Vital cultures can be kept for weeks and maintain structure and neuronal functions (\"organotypic\")."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11808 "Useful for many types of brain research including electrophysiological, biochemical and morphological measurements in studies of neurotoxicity."^^xsd:string)
