AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11832 "inhibitory post-synaptic potential")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11832 "Referring to a more negative membrane potential at the postsynaptic side of the synaptic cleft that renders the postsynaptic neuron less likely to generate an action potential.")
