AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11859 "Labyrinthine system, in which the ability of an animal (usually a rodent) to find a direct route from a starting point to a specific location is observed.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11859 "Different mazes are available for psychological and neurotoxicity testing. Maze tests suitable for studying spatial navigation, learning, memory, cognition, anxiety and other behaviours have been developed."^^xsd:string)
