AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11864 "Inflammation or infection of the meninges.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11864 "Although bacterial and viral infections are the most common causes, there are also non-infectious causes including cancers, autoimmune disease and head injury."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11864 "Several common drugs may cause aseptic meningitis."^^xsd:string)
