AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11871 "Originally a toxic by-product in the illicit manufacture of the synthetic opioid meperidine, thus with neurotoxicity first detected in drug abusers, it is used as a model substance for studying the pathogenesis of parkinsonism."^^xsd:string)
