AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11881 "Hypothesis that the intracranial volume is unchangeable and therefore a constant intracranial pressure requires that the sum of the volumes of the three compartments blood, brain tissue and cerebrospinal fluid remains constant.")
