AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11911 "Rate of progression of a nerve impulse in a peripheral nerve or in its largest component nerve fibers.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:11911 "It is measured to provide information on the intactness of the nerve."^^xsd:string)
