AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:11983 "pain")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:11983 "Conscious awareness of an unpleasant sensation mediated by nerve conduction of a stimulus from a site of tissue injury to the brain. Note 1: Chemical mediators of pain include histamine, bradykinins, and prostaglandins. Note 2: The sensation may occur or persist when the injured tissue is no longer present, as in phantom pain. Sensation one feels when hurt in body or mind.")
