AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12037 "Pyramidal cells are also found in other brain areas such as the hippocampus."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12037 "They are thought to play a role in cognitive function."^^xsd:string)
