AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:12044 "Involuntary reaction in response to a stimulus applied to the periphery following its transmission to the nervous centers in the brain or spinal cord.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12044 "Often contraction of a muscle due to a stimulus applied to its proprioceptors."^^xsd:string)
