AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12046 "Reinforcement may be positive (using a desirable stimulus) or negative (removing or withholding an adverse stimulus)."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12046 "In contrast to reinforcement, use of stimuli to decrease a behavior is called punishment."^^xsd:string)
