AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:12131 "Neurological syndrome characterized by muscle twitches, cramps, and spasms; and in severe forms, by spasm of the muscles of the larynx (laryngospasm) and seizures.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12131 "Often reflecting irritability of the central and peripheral nervous systems resulting from a low concentration of ionized calcium in the serum."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:12131 goldbook:11699)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:12131 goldbook:12003)
