AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:12937 "Bone marrow-derived lymphocyte, expressing an antigen-receptor complex composed of membrane-bound immunoglobulin (Ig) and associated molecular chains.")
AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:12937 "B cell")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12937 "B-cell receptors (BCRs) interact with epitopes directly [no major histocompatibility complex (MHC) restriction]. Mature activated B lymphocytes (plasma cells) produce antibody and are efficient antigen-presenting cells (APCs)."^^xsd:string)
