AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:12949 "Use of small particles, e.g., colloidal gold, as a vehicle for carrying agents (drugs, nucleic acid, etc.) into a cell.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:12949 "Following coating with the desired agent(s), the particles are fired into the dermis of the recipient using a helium-powered gun."^^xsd:string)
