AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13138 "Membrane-bound Fc receptors mediate different effector functions [e.g., endocytosis, antibody-dependent-cellular cytotoxicity (ADCC)] and induce mediator release. Both the membrane-bound and soluble forms of Fc receptors regulate antibody production by B lymphocytes."^^xsd:string)
