AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:13186 "granzyme")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:13186 "Member of a family of serine esterases present in the granules of cytotoxic T lymphocytes and natural killer (NK) cells. They induce apoptosis in the target cell that they enter through perforin channels inserted into the target cell membrane by the cytotoxic lymphocyte.")
