AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:13192 "B-cell neoplasm, usually occurring during middle age, constituting about \\(\\pu{2\\%}\\) of all leukemias and responding well to chemotherapy. The neoplastic cells have fine, hairlike surfaces.")
