AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13651 "It primarily affects the joints, causing symmetrical lesions and severe damage to the affected joints. RA is the most common form of inflammatory joint disease (prevalence about \\(\\pu{0.5}\\) to \\(\\pu{1\\%}\\))."^^xsd:string)
