AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:13658 "sarcoid")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13658 "There is usually diminished or absent reactivity to tuberculin, and in most active cases, a positive Kveim reaction."^^xsd:string)
