AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13660 "There are two types: progressive systemic sclerosis, and a more limited and less rapidly progressive form known as CREST syndrome, referring to Calcinosis, Raynaud phenomenon, Esophageal dysfunction, Sclerodactyly, and Telangiectasias."^^xsd:string)
