AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:13669 "Specific immunological unresponsiveness to a defined autoantigen.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13669 "Primary (clonal deletion, anergy, clonal indifference) and secondary or regulatory (interclonal competition, suppression, immune deviation, vetoing, feedback regulation by the idiotypic network) mechanisms are involved in the induction and maintenance of self-tolerance."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:13669 "Breaking self-tolerance may lead to pathological autoimmunity and development of autoimmune disease."^^xsd:string)
