AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:15499 "Bateman function")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:15499 "Equation expressing the build up and decay in concentration of a substance (usually in plasma) based on first-order uptake and elimination in a one-compartment model, having the form \\[C = [fDk_{\\rm{a}}/V(k_{\\rm{a}} - k_{\\rm{e}})] [\\exp(-k_{\\rm{e}}t) - \\exp(-k_{\\rm{a}}t)] \\]where \\(C\\) is the concentration and \\(D\\) the dose of the substance, \\(f\\) the fraction absorbed, and \\(V\\) the volume of distribution. \\(k_{\\rm{a}}\\) and \\(k_{\\rm{e}}\\) are the first-order rate constants of uptake and elimination, respectively, and \\(t\\) is time.")
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:15499 doi:10.1351/pac200779071153)
