AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:15633 "dependence")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:15633 "A psychic craving for a drug or other substance that may or may not be accompanied by a physical dependency. Reliance on a drug or other substance to maintain health.")
