AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:15645 "Natural tendency shown by an individual or group of individuals, including any tendency to acquisition of specific diseases, often due to hereditary factors. Total of the processes of absorption of a chemical into the circulatory systems, distribution throughout the body, biotransformation, and excretion.")
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:15645 doi:10.1351/pac200779071153)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:15645 "current"^^xsd:string)
