AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:15776 "Hill plot")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:15776 "Graphical method for analyzing binding of a molecule \\(\\ce{A}\\) to a macromolecule \\(\\ce{P}\\) with \\(n\\) binding sites. A Hill plot of \\(\\log[\\theta/(1 - \\theta)]\\) vs. \\(\\log[\\ce{A}]\\) has a slope of 1 if binding is noncooperative and \\(\\gt 1\\) for cooperative binding, where \\(\\theta = [\\ce{A}]_{\\rm{bound}}/n[\\ce{P}]_{\\rm{total}}\\) is the fraction of sites occupied.")
