AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:16022 "Radical nitrogen-based molecules that can act to facilitate nitrosylation reactions; reactive nitrogen species include dioxidonitrogen(\\(\\ce{^{.}}\\)) (nitrogen dioxide, nitryl radical) \\(\\ce{NO^{.}}\\), oxidonitrogen(\\(\\ce{^{.}}\\)) (nitrogen monoxide, nitrosyl radical) \\(\\ce{NO^{.}}\\) oxidonitrogen(1+) (nitrosyl cation) \\(\\ce{NO^{+}}\\), hydroxyoxidonitrogen (nitrous acid) \\(\\ce{HNO2}\\), and oxidonitrate(1-) \\(\\ce{NO^{-}}\\).")
AnnotationAssertion(Annotation(oboInOwl:hasSynonymType OMO:0003000) oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:16022 "RNS")
