AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:16044 "Substance used mainly to repel blood-sucking insects in order to protect humans and animals.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:16044 "This term may also be used for substances used to repel mammals, birds, rodents, mites, plant pests, etc."^^xsd:string)
