AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:16098 "Death rate computed for a subpopulation of individual organisms or people having a specified characteristic or attribute, and named accordingly.")
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:16098 doi:10.1351/pac200779071153)
