AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:16151 "Study designed to establish the pattern of pesticide residue intake by a person consuming a defined diet. Study undertaken to show the range and amount of various foodstuffs in a typical diet or to estimate the total amount of a specific substance in a typical diet.")
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:16151 doi:10.1351/pac200779071153)
