AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:A00123 "Groups formed by removing one or more hydroxy groups from oxoacids that have the general structure $\\ce{R_{k}E(=O)_{l}(OH)_{m}}$ ($l  eq 0$), and replacement analogues of such acyl groups. In organic chemistry an unspecified acyl group is commonly a carboxylic acyl group. E.g.")
