AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:A00249 "alternant")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:A00249 "A conjugated system of $\\ce{\\uppi\\!\\mbox{-}electrons}$ is termed alternant if its atoms can be divided into two sets so that no atom of one set is directly linked to any other atom of the same set.")
