AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:A00452 "arsines")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:A00452 "AsH3 and compounds derived from it by substituting one, two or three hydrogen atoms by hydrocarbyl groups: $\\ce{R3As}$, $\\ce{RAsH2}$, $\\ce{R2AsH}$, $\\ce{R3As}$ ($\\ce{R}  eq \\ce{H}$) are called primary, secondary and tertiary arsines, respectively. A specific arsine is preferably named as a substituted arsane, e.g. $\\ce{CH3CH2AsH2}$ ethylarsane.")
