AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:A00536 "auxochrome")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:A00536 "An atom or group which, when added to or introduced into a chromophore, causes a bathochromic shift and/or a hyperchromic effect in a given band of the chromophore, usually in that of lowest frequency. This term is obsolete.")
