AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:B00729 "A branch unit from which \\(f\\) linear chains emanate may be termed an f-functional branch unit, e.g. five-functional branch unit. Alternatively, the terms trifunctional, tetrafunctional, pentafunctional, etc. may be used, e.g. pentafunctional branch unit."^^xsd:string)
