AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:C00878 "catalyst ageing")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:C00878 "Catalyst deactivation resulting from changes in the structure or in the texture of the catalyst. Changes of this kind are usually irreversible and the catalyst cannot be regenerated.")
