AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:C00883 "Use of the term level as a synonym for concentration is deprecated."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:C00883 "In describing a quantity, content must be clearly differentiated from concentration."^^xsd:string)
