AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:C00906 "For a reaction with a single rate-determining step \\[\\frac{\\alpha _{\\rm{c}}}{ u } = -\\frac{R\\ T}{n\\ F}\\ (\\frac{\\partial (\\ln (|I_{\\rm{c}}|))}{\\partial E})_{T,p,c_{i},...}\\] where \\(\\alpha _{\\rm{c}}\\) is the cathodic transfer coefficient (number), \\(R\\) is the gas constant, \\(T\\) is the thermodynamic temperature, and \\( u \\) the stoichiometric number giving the number of identical activated complexes formed and destroyed in the completion of the overall reaction as formulated with the transfer of \\(n\\) electrons.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:C00906 goldbook:C01124)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:C00906 goldbook:G02579)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:C00906 goldbook:S06025)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:C00906 goldbook:T06321)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:C00906 doi:10.1351/pac197437040499)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:C00906 "current"^^xsd:string)
