AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:C00934 "centrifugal barrier")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:C00934 "In a reaction without an electronic energy barrier, or its reverse, the rotational energy of the transition state gives rise to a reaction barrier, which is known as the centrifugal barrier.")
