Declaration(Class(goldbook:CT06821))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:CT06821 "cytochrome P450")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:CT06821 "Member of a superfamily of heme-containing monooxygenases involved in xenobiotic metabolism, cholesterol biosynthesis, and steroidogenesis, in eukaryotic organisms found mainly in the endoplasmic reticulum and inner mitochondrial membrane of cells. ‘P450’ refers to a feature in the carbon monoxide absorption difference spectrum at \\(450\\ \\rm{nm}\\) caused by the presence of a thiolate in the axial position of the heme opposite to the carbon monoxide ligand.")
