AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:CT07348 "CW laser")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:CT07348 "Some lasers are called CW mode-locked. This indicates that the pulse average power is constant, i.e., there is no Q-switched mode locking."^^xsd:string)
