Declaration(Class(goldbook:D01572))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:D01572 "degrees of freedom")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:D01572 "A statistical quantity indicating the number of values which could be arbitrarily assigned within the specification of a system of observations. For simple replication, with \\(n\\) measurements and one estimated parameter (the mean), \\( u =n- 1\\). More generally, for multivariable computations, the number of degrees of freedom equals the number of observations minus the number of fitted parameters.")
