AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:GT07387 "geminate ion pair")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:GT07387 "Ion pair formed from a precursor that constitutes a single kinetic entity, i.e., by electron transfer or ion transfer in an encounter complex (cf. collision complex) or by ionic dissociation of a single molecular entity.")
