AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:H01881 "An affix giving a topological indication of the bonding between a $\\ce{\\uppi\\!\\mbox{-}electron}$ ligand and the central atom in a coordination entity. A right superscript numerical index indicates the number of ligating atoms in the $\\ce{\\uppi\\!\\mbox{-}electron}$ system of the ligand which bind to the central atom.")
