AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:H02876 "Addition of water or of the elements of water (i.e. H and OH) to a molecular entity. For example, hydration of ethene:  The term is also used in a more restricted sense for the process:")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:H02876 "Compare the use of the term in inorganic/physical chemistry to describe the state of the ions of an electrolyte in aqueous solution."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:H02876 goldbook:A00132)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:H02876 goldbook:A00426)
