AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:H02912 "Compounds derived from oxoacids $\\ce{R_{k}E(=O)_{l}(OH)_{m}}$ ($l  eq 0$) by replacing $\\ce{=O}$ by $\\ce{=NOH}$ ($\\ce{=NOR}$), as in carbohydroximic acids, $\\ce{RC(OH)=NOH}$, and sulfonohydroximic acids, $\\ce{RS(=O)(=NOH)OH}$.")
