AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:H02928 "hypo-phase")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:H02928 "The denser phase in an extraction system. This term is often used when two non-aqueous phases are present or when the solvent is an aqueous phase.")
