AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:H02929 "hypsochromic shift")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:H02929 "Shift of a spectral band to higher frequency or shorter wavelength upon substitution or change in medium. It is informally referred to as blue shift.")
