AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:L03504 "leukotrienes")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:L03504 "Linear $\\ce{C20}$ endogenous metabolites of arachidonic acid (icosa-5,8,11,14-tetraenoic acid) containing a terminal carboxy function and four or more double bonds (three or more of which are conjugated) as well as other functional groups. A subclass of icosanoids.")
