Declaration(Class(goldbook:L03509))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:L03509 "Lewis acidity")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:L03509 "The thermodynamic tendency of a substrate to act as a Lewis acid. Comparative measures of this property are provided by the equilibrium constants for Lewis adduct formation of a series of Lewis acids with a common reference Lewis base.")
