AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:L03646 "Of a source of luminous intensity \\(I\\) in an element of solid angle \\(\\rm{d}\\varOmega\\) is given by \\(\\rm{d}\\varPhi = I\\ \\rm{d}\\varOmega\\).")
