AnnotationAssertion(oboInOwl:hasRelatedSynonym goldbook:LT07176 "liquid crystal polymer")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:LT07176 "A liquid-crystalline polymer can exhibit one or more liquid state(s) with one- or two-dimensional, long-range orientational order over certain ranges of temperatures either in the melt (thermotropic liquid-crystalline polymer) or in solution (lyotropic liquid-crystalline polymer)."^^xsd:string)
