Declaration(Class(goldbook:N04112))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:N04112 "network")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:N04112 "A highly ramified macromolecule in which essentially each constitutional unit is connected to each other constitutional unit and to the macroscopic phase boundary by many permanent paths through the macromolecule, the number of such paths increasing with the average number of intervening bonds; the paths must on the average be co-extensive with the macromolecule.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:N04112 "Usually, and in all systems that exhibit rubber elasticity, the number of distinct paths is very high, but, in most cases, some constitutional units exist which are connected by a single path only."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:N04112 "If the permanent paths through the structure of a network are all formed by covalent bonds, the term covalent network may be used."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:N04112 "The term physical network may be used if the permanent paths through the structure of a network are not all formed by covalent bonds but, at least in part, by physical interactions, such that removal of the interactions leaves individual macromolecules or a macromolecule that is not a network."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:N04112 goldbook:C01288)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:N04112 goldbook:M03667)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:N04112 goldbook:NT07562)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:N04112 goldbook:P04665)
