AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:O04331 "ortho acids")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:O04331 "Hypothetical compounds having the structure $\\ce{RC(OH)3}$. Thus, hydrated forms of carboxylic acids. Orthocarbonic acid, $\\ce{C(OH)4}$, is generically included.")
