AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:P04553 "phosphines")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:P04553 "$\\ce{PH3}$ and compounds derived from it by substituting one, two or three hydrogen atoms by hydrocarbyl groups $\\ce{R3P}$. $\\ce{RPH2}$, $\\ce{R2PH}$ and $\\ce{R3P}$ ($\\ce{R}  eq \\ce{H}$) are called primary, secondary and tertiary phosphines, respectively. A specific phosphine is preferably named as a substituted phosphane, e.g. $\\ce{CH3PH2}$ methylphosphane.")
