AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:P04876 "promoter")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:P04876 "A relatively small quantity of one or more substances, which when added to a catalyst improves the activity, the selectivity, or the useful lifetime of the catalyst. In general, a promoter may either augment a desired reaction or suppress an undesired one.")
