AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:PT06836 "Enzymic modification of a substance by oxidation, reduction, hydrolysis, hydration, dehydrochlorination, or other reactions catalyzed by enzymes of the cytosol, of the endoplasmic reticulum (microsomal enzymes) or of other cell organelles.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:PT06836 goldbook:E02159)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:PT06836 goldbook:H02876)
