AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:PT07570 "Polymer network composed of chains all of which are connected at both of their ends to different junction points.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:PT07570 "If a perfect network is in the rubbery state then, on macroscopic deformation of the network, all of its chains are elastically active and display rubber elasticity."^^xsd:string)
