AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:PT07627 "precipitation")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:PT07627 "Sedimentation of a solid material (a precipitate) from a liquid solution in which the material is present in amounts greater than its solubility in the liquid.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:PT07627 "When precipitation occurs in sol-gel processing, sol particles have aggregated to a size where gravitational forces cause them to sink or float. Generally, aggregation arises from a change in the sol that reduces the interparticle repulsion."^^xsd:string)
