AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:R05069 goldbook:S05900)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:R05069 doi:10.1351/pac199466051077)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:R05069 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:R05071))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:R05071 "radical copolymerization")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:R05071 "A copolymerization which is a radical polymerization.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:R05071 goldbook:C01336)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:R05071 goldbook:R05075)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:R05071 doi:10.1351/pac199668122287)
AnnotationAssertion(obo:goldbook#hasStatus goldbook:R05071 "current"^^xsd:string)
Declaration(Class(goldbook:R05073))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:R05073 "radical ion")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:R05073 "A radical that carries an electric charge. A positively charged radical is called a 'radical cation' (e.g. the benzene radical cation $\\ce{C6H6^{.+}}$); a negatively charged radical is called a 'radical anion' (e.g. the benzene radical anion $\\ce{C6H^{.−}}$ or the benzophenone radical anion $\\ce{Ph2C–O^{.−}}$). Commonly, but not necessarily, the odd electron and the charge are associated with the same atom. Unless the positions of unpaired spin and charge can be associated with specific atoms, superscript dot and charge designations should be placed in the order $\\ce{^{.+}}$ or $\\ce{^{.-}}$ suggested by the name 'radical ion'. (e.g. $\\ce{C3H6^{.+}}$).")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment goldbook:R05073 "In the previous edition of this Compendium, it was recommended to place the charge designation directly above the centrally placed dot. However, this format is now discouraged because of the difficulty of extending it to ions bearing more than one charge, and/or more than one unpaired electron. In mass spectroscopic usage the symbol for the charge precedes the dot representing the unpaired electron."^^xsd:string)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:R05073 goldbook:E01923)
AnnotationAssertion(mito:isMentionedBy goldbook:R05073 doi:10.1351/pac199466051077)
