AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:R05423 "<i>R</i>, <i>S</i>")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:R05423 "The approved designations (devised by Cahn, Ingold and Prelog) of absolute configuration at four-coordinate (quadriligant) and six-coordinate (sexiligant) stereogenic centres.")
