Declaration(Class(goldbook:S05885))
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label goldbook:S05885 "splicing")
AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:S05885 "of RNA: The procedure by which introns are removed from eukaryotic precursor mRNA molecules and adjacent exon sequences are joined together (spliced).of DNA: Manipulation for joining together double-stranded DNA fragments with protruding single-stranded 'sticky ends' by means of ligases.")
