AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:T06500 "The diradical $\\ce{CH2=C(C^{.}H2)2}$, 2-methylenepropane-1,3-diyl, for which no Kekulé structure can be written, and its hydrocarbyl derivatives.")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:seeAlso goldbook:T06500 goldbook:D01765)
