AnnotationAssertion(dcterms:description goldbook:T06513 "A specific name for the atom $\\ce{^{3}H}$. The cation $\\ce{^{3}H^{+}}$ is a triton, the species $\\ce{^{3}H^{−}}$ is a tritide anion and $\\ce{^{3}H}$ is the tritio group.")
